Hmm, sorry, I'm gonna start differently. Why I wanted to do this event was not really to make like a competition and say, okay, you have Jung, you have Freud, who's correct? Who's right? Jung himself gave the answer on that, and he said, it's just a different way how the psyche works.

00:48:10.116 --> 00:48:34.561
Not every person is the same and there are different ways how the psyche operates for a person personality-wise. And he said, there are people who work, their psyche works in a Freudian sense. They're completely Freudian. It, it works actually for them like that. But then there are also other people who work like Alfred Adler, who was also very famous back then.

00:48:35.349 --> 00:48:45.719
How his psychology focused on power instead of sexuality. And he said there's a subset of people whose minds seem to work like Jung's mind.

00:48:47.889 --> 00:49:02.225
