00:49:04.759 --> 00:49:25.156
Freudian analysis would work and it would work really well to get people out of the basement of the parents, to establish them in the world, to redirect the libido outwards, to take them out of the family unit, to not have them be children anymore, but rather establish their own life and establish themselves in the world.

00:49:26.504 --> 00:49:47.735
And there he said the success rate was very, very high and it would really help people. But it's just a specific area where this works. The second part of life does not work in a Freudian sense anymore because people very often are already established.

00:49:48.480 --> 00:50:06.013
They have a partner, they have a career, a house, whatever. They are established. So trying to get them out of the basement of their parents does not work because they are already out for a very long time. So the methods that are needed are then different.

